### List full category tree
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{categoryReadToken.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Get root category subtree
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories/{{rootCategory.response.body.$.id}}/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{categoryReadToken.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Get operations subtree
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories/{{operationsCategory.response.body.$.id}}/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{categoryReadToken.response.body.$.access_token}}

### Get finance subtree
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories/{{financeCategory.response.body.$.id}}/tree
Authorization: Bearer {{categoryReadToken.response.body.$.access_token}}
